Material Web
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Parts of packages/react are adapted from Material Web
(https://github.com/material-components/material-web), Copyright 2022 Google LLC,
used under the Apache License 2.0:

  - packages/react/src/foundation/ripple-controller.ts: the press-ripple state
    machine and its timing constants (ripple/internal/ripple.ts), reworked as a
    framework-agnostic controller. Changes are listed in the file header.
  - tools/codegen/src/emit-system.ts (`elevationShadow`): the closed-form
    elevation shadow curves (elevation/internal/_elevation.scss).

