Shape geometry and morphing
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
packages/react/src/shapes (the rounded polygon, cubic Bézier, feature, measuring, feature
mapping and morph algorithms, and the numbers that define the catalogue of 35 shapes) is
adapted from Flutter's material_ui package
(https://github.com/flutter/packages, packages/material_ui/lib/src/shapes and
material_shapes.dart), Copyright 2013 The Flutter Authors, used under the BSD 3-Clause
licence (see THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md). That code is itself a Dart port of the AndroidX
graphics-shapes library and of the Compose Material 3 shape catalogue, Copyright 2022 and
2023 The Android Open Source Project, licensed under the Apache License 2.0. The tests in
packages/react/src/shapes/shapes.test.ts are ported from Flutter's tests for the same code.
Each adapted file says what changed.

